      "dimensions": {
        "A": "当前全文809行与实际shell呈现顺序补读；hold在palette后、清屏前，dither快照在clear前、菜单在dither后。两个palette clock reads及其event等待归属均不改；独立场景/战斗owner不混并。",
        "B": "纠正role0镜像为旧档专用、NPC默认1/帧数推断与screen Y隐含中心四处失实注释；冻结偏移明确walking捕获和事件/场景重置，不凭空归因反序列化。",
        "C": "碰撞调用改向scene-collision纯计算叶，断开present→scene-system→event/menu/加载依赖；真实scene-system原样reexport证明同函数。同步seam scratch每次全清、无await/外部callback，不存语义状态，保留有界复用。",
        "D": "partyFrameIndex/follower/render/tile/seam/dither等已有真实共享；gameOver与常规remap位置不同、overlay时序不同，不因相似小循环机械抽万能渲染器。",
        "E": "旧全文与composition112/root319原件按原域复用且不相加；当前六实际文件92绿/无stderr。补核现有时钟/hold/真实像素、只对绘制帧选择使用spy；正文证明除同函数import外零运行变化，无新增镜像测试。",
        "F": "持序的层级编排需要显式短路，复杂度85只作线索；位置/姿态/遮挡已交窄helper。当前不为减指标把冻结与正常路径绕进布尔helper；clock调用点直接可见。",
        "G": "去掉已为Uint8Array的冗余强转；五公开入口及context字段由shell与相邻实际调用消费，无本次死出口。旧render-clock-design是设计候选，本次实证决议保留现有平台时钟边界，无新兼容层或永久豁免。",
        "H": "Framebuffer/Context直接可控，既有performance.now spy+afterEach restore能区分600ms终点、auto/awaited与dither0/36/72，动画时钟无需新公共注入接口。Canvas仅flush适配，真实像素与命令调用分层；不声称新视觉/E2E。"
      },
      "currentReview": "Full current target read; old full A/oracles retained at their exact scope, current design/clock/caller/test gaps read and adjudicated.",
      "remaining": "No blocking eight-axis gap; render-clock-design resolved by explicit retention decision with controllable existing clock tests. Unified phase gates/publication pending.",
      "changes": "Direct collision leaf dependency, misleading comments corrected, redundant assertion removed",
      "verification": [
        "6 actual files/92 identities green/0 stderr",
        "emitted whole module equal after sole exact-reexport import normalization",
        "existing clock/hold pixel contracts reused; no new browser/visual claim"
      ]
    }
  ],
